  "Explored": "探索方案",
  "not shipped": "未上线",
  "The paired entry and exit animations made the mode change expressive. The concept received positive feedback from the Design Council, but neither animation shipped.": "相互呼应的进入与退出动效，让模式切换更有表现力。这个概念获得了 Design Council 的积极反馈，但两段动画都未上线。",
