  "The control made the active mode more visible during the conversation, preserving the intent of the unshipped transitions.": "控件在对话过程中持续突出当前模式，延续了未上线的过渡动效原本的设计意图。",
  "The mode shipped on web and mobile.": "体验在网页端与移动端上线。",
  "The shipped version used primary-button styling to make the active mode more prominent. The paired transitions remained a design exploration.": "上线版本采用主按钮样式，突出当前模式。相互呼应的进入与退出动画则保留为设计探索。",
  "The primary-button styling shipped on web and mobile, keeping the active-mode cue visible during the conversation. It was designed to make the intended boundary of Temporary Chat easier to recognize.": "网页端与移动端均上线了主按钮样式，在对话过程中持续提示当前模式。这个设计旨在让用户更容易辨认临时对话的边界。",
  "Clarity has to last beyond the transition.": "切换结束之后，清晰感还要继续。",
