  "How Tsong Li designed Copilot Temporary Chat for web and mobile, explored paired entry and exit animations, and adapted the mode control for launch when the animations could not ship.": "Tsong Li 负责 Copilot 临时对话的网页端与移动端设计，探索相互呼应的进入与退出动效，并在动画无法上线时调整了最终发布的模式控件。",
  "Copilot Temporary Chat concepts across desktop and mobile, showing a temporary-mode indicator and conversation entry views.": "Copilot 临时对话桌面端与移动端概念稿，呈现临时模式标识及对话入口界面。",
  "Desktop and mobile Temporary Chat concepts, showing the mode indicator and conversation entry views.": "临时对话桌面端与移动端概念稿，呈现模式标识及对话入口界面。",
  "View full-size Temporary Chat design": "查看完整的临时对话设计",
  "Desktop Deep Research report with a chart and a mobile report-share preview; the rainfall example is illustrative.": "Deep Research 桌面报告及图表，旁边是移动端报告分享预览；其中的降雨示例仅用于展示。",
  "A desktop report with a chart sits alongside a mobile sharing preview. The rainfall example is illustrative.": "带图表的桌面端报告旁，展示了移动端的分享预览。降雨内容仅作示例。",
  "View full-size Deep Research design": "查看完整尺寸的 Deep Research 设计",
  "Four mobile Deep Research views: a report card in a conversation, a full report with a chart, an iOS share preview, and Android sharing destinations. The sample rainfall report is illustrative.": "四个 Deep Research 移动端界面：对话中的报告卡片、带图表的完整报告、iOS 分享预览，以及 Android 分享选项。降雨报告仅为示例。",
  "From left to right: a report card in conversation, a full report with a chart, then iOS and Android sharing views. The sample rainfall content is illustrative.": "从左至右：对话中的报告卡片、带图表的完整报告，以及 iOS 和 Android 分享界面。降雨内容仅为示例。",
  "View full-size mobile Deep Research designs": "查看完整尺寸的 Deep Research 移动端设计",
  "Four prepared Promotion Card variants: English left-to-right and Arabic right-to-left layouts, each in light and dark appearance. Text alignment and overlapping report and document illustrations are composed for each reading direction.": "四种已准备的 Promotion Card 版本：英语从左至右、阿拉伯语从右至左，并各有浅色和深色呈现。文字对齐方式及相互叠放的报告与文档插图，均针对相应阅读方向分别编排。",
  "The four prepared variants cover English left-to-right and Arabic right-to-left layouts, each in light and dark appearances. Text alignment and the overlapping report and document illustrations follow each reading direction.": "四个已准备好的版本包括英语从左至右和阿拉伯语从右至左的布局，各有浅色、深色两种样式。文字对齐方式，以及报告与文档插图的叠放关系，都按各自的阅读方向编排。",
  "View full-size Promotion Card designs": "查看完整尺寸的 Promotion Card 设计",
  "Copilot Deep Research: Tsong Li Portfolio": "Copilot Deep Research：Tsong Li 设计作品集",
  "Copilot Deep Research: reports made easier to share": "Copilot Deep Research：让报告更容易理解与分享",
  "Four shipped enhancements to how research reports are presented and shared.": "四项已上线的报告体验改进，涵盖信息呈现与分享。",
  "Charts, the Copilot Web Report Card, web and mobile sharing, and the Promotion Card for launch": "报告图表、Copilot 网页端报告卡片、网页端与移动端分享，以及配合功能发布的 Promotion Card",
  "All four enhancements shipped": "四项改进均已上线",
  "01 / Overview & contribution": "01 / 项目与我的工作",
