  "I led design for these report-experience enhancements as part of the wider Deep Research team.": "作为 Deep Research 团队的一员，我主导了这四项报告体验改进的设计。",
  "02 / Four enhancements": "02 / 四项改进",
  "Four ways to strengthen the report experience.": "围绕报告体验，补齐四个环节。",
  "Charts": "图表",
