  "I designed the Promotion Card that accompanied the feature launch.": "我设计了配合功能发布的 Promotion Card。",
  "03 / The sharing decision": "03 / 分享范围的取舍",
  "Show people what will travel with the report.": "分享之前，先看清哪些内容会被带出去。",
  "Before the redesign, there was no sharing preview. People could not tell whether they would share the report or the entire conversation. This mattered because the conversation could include unrelated or sensitive discussion.": "改版前，分享功能没有内容预览，用户无法判断分享的是报告还是整段对话。对话中可能包含无关或敏感内容，因此需要明确告知分享范围。",
  "I wanted people to see what they were about to share. The starting point could determine how much context to include: sharing from a conversation could include the prompt that led to the report, while sharing from the report itself could include only a link to the report.": "我希望用户在分享前就能看清包含哪些内容。分享的发起位置可以决定附带多少上下文：从对话中分享，可以带上触发报告的提问；从报告页面分享，则只包含报告链接。",
