  "The final design combined a personalized desktop feed with focused mobile views. It connected market movements, company events, and their context so readers could follow the relationships between headlines.": "最终设计结合了个性化桌面信息流和内容更集中的移动端视图，将市场动态、公司事件和相关背景联系起来，让读者看懂新闻标题之间的关系。",
