  "The desktop feed opened with a personalized introduction, with market indices and company coverage side by side. The mobile market brief brought general and personalized index context into a focused view, following the same sequence: what happened, why, and why now.": "桌面信息流以个性化介绍开场，并列展示市场指数和公司新闻。移动端市场简报则集中呈现整体与个性化的指数信息，同样依次说明发生了什么、为何发生，以及为什么现在值得关注。",
  "Mobile market-brief views, general and personalized, showing index summaries, charts, and context": "移动端市场简报的整体与个性化视图，展示指数摘要、图表及相关背景",
  "Open market-brief video in browser": "在浏览器中打开市场简报视频",
  "Mobile market brief: a short silent recording of general and personalized views, with index summaries, charts, and explanatory context. Figures are illustrative, not live data.": "移动端市场简报：静音短片展示整体与个性化视图中的指数摘要、图表及说明。数值仅作示意，并非实时数据。",
  "Mobile stock-update cards showing company, price movement, event explanations, and sources": "移动端个股更新卡片，展示公司、价格变化、事件说明与来源",
