  "I used AI to prototype a complex tax workflow, then narrowed its scope and rebuilt it with feedback from finance and engineering.": "我用 AI 为复杂的税务流程搭建原型，再根据财务和工程团队的反馈缩小范围、重建方案。",
  "Microsoft Advertising tax operations": "Microsoft Advertising 税务运营",
  "Product design, AI-assisted prototyping, and cross-functional collaboration": "产品设计、AI 辅助原型与跨团队协作",
  "Clarifying and validating a three-stage tax-record workflow": "梳理并验证三阶段税务记录流程",
  "Agreed logic incorporated into the PRD for engineering": "将已达成一致的逻辑写入 PRD，交付工程团队",
  "01 / Make requirements concrete": "01 / 把需求变成可讨论的原型",
  "02 / Narrow the workflow": "02 / 收敛工作流程",
