  "A multilingual experience depends on translation, layout, typography, platform behavior, and how teams hand off the work.": "多语言体验既取决于译文，也取决于布局、字体、平台表现和团队的交付方式。",
  "Lark collaboration suite": "Lark 协作套件",
  "Multilingual standards and workflow design": "多语言规范与工作流程设计",
  "Engineering, R&D, and content teams": "工程、研发与内容团队",
  "Design rules, translation-tool behavior, and verification": "设计规则、翻译工具逻辑与验证方法",
  "01 / More than translation": "01 / 不只是翻译",
  "02 / Make language behavior explicit": "02 / 明确多语言规则",
  "03 / Put checks in the workflow": "03 / 将检查融入工作流",
  "04 / Verify what ships": "04 / 验证交付表现",
  "Every language brings its own layout questions.": "每一种语言，都有自己的布局问题。",
  "In a multilingual collaboration product, translated text can change line breaks, text length, font weight, and component rendering across platforms. Even an accurate translation can leave a screen cramped or inconsistent.": "在多语言协作产品中，译文会影响换行、文本长度、字重和组件在不同平台上的显示。即使翻译准确，换一种语言后，界面也可能变得拥挤或不一致。",
  "Designers, content partners, and engineers also needed to agree on release checks and multilingual file handoff. I led that collaboration to clarify the rules and each team's responsibilities.": "设计、内容和工程团队还需要明确版本发布前检查什么、如何交接多语言文件。我牵头与这些团队协作，细化规则和各方职责。",
  "Turn edge cases into design guidance teams can reuse.": "把零散问题，整理成团队能复用的规则。",
  "I helped define standards for word boundaries, line breaks, overflow, font behavior, platform rendering, and component adaptation. We wanted multilingual behavior specified during design, before translated text was placed for a final visual check.": "我参与制定了分词边界、换行、溢出、字体表现、跨平台显示和组件适配规范。目标是让团队在设计阶段就明确多语言规则，不必等填入译文后才检查视觉问题。",
  "These rules tied language choices to layout and typography, helping teams check whether a screen would remain readable after translation.": "这些规则将语言内容与布局、排版要求对应起来，帮助团队检查翻译后的页面是否仍然清楚易读。",
  "Make the right work easier to repeat.": "让正确的检查，更容易持续执行。",
