  "We included the tool in the handoff SOP so the checks became part of the team's delivery process. Translation, typography, and implementation guidance could then accompany the work in one place.": "我们将工具纳入交付 SOP，把相关检查放进日常交付流程。翻译、排版和实现要求也能随设计一起交接，便于集中查阅。",
